# data/sounds — original tones (WL-3.6)

Every file here is synthesized from scratch by `tools/gensounds`
(sine envelopes, no samples, no Meta audio). Regenerate:

    go run ./tools/gensounds [outdir]   # default data/sounds
    make sounds

| File | Use |
|---|---|
| `notice.wav` | incoming message notification |
| `sent.wav` | message sent tick |
| `receive.wav` | message received tick |
| `ringtone.wav` | incoming call loop (2 s) |

License: same MIT terms as the repo (`LICENSE`). Per-chat tone
picker binds filenames under this dir (WL-3.6 UI row in Settings).
